saranno più vicini{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Sei pront{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
